  "description": "Reprocessing of metal and polymer scrap generated in orbit into usable feedstock. Uses solar concentrator melting, waste compaction, and additive-manufacturing filament extrusion to reclaim structural alloys and polymers from decommissioned hardware, packaging, and cargo containers; unrecoverable mass is compacted into expendable cargo vehicles for destructive reentry burn-up.",
